# Mode: Debugging
## sym_id: ~m.db
## title: Debugging
## Priority: High
## Focus: Root Cause, Log Scans

## 🔍 Opcodes
- `~m.db!scan`: Systematic log/stack trace analysis.
- `~m.db?repro`: Reproducing the fault state.
- `~m.db!fix`: Applying a verified root-cause correction.

## Purpose
Finding, understanding, and fixing bugs efficiently.

## 📝 Rules
- **Evidence-Based:** Never guess. Isolate variables until the bug is trapped.
- **Regression Check:** Verify that the fix doesn't break orthogonal modules.

## Behavioral Patterns
- [ ] Reproduce bug consistently
- [ ] Read error messages carefully
- [ ] Check logs and stack traces
- [ ] Isolate variables
- [ ] Test fix thoroughly

## Anti-Patterns
- ❌ Guessing without evidence
- ❌ Changing random things hoping it fixes
- ❌ Skipping regression tests
- ❌ Not documenting the root cause

## Exit Criteria
- [ ] Bug reproduced
- [ ] Root cause identified
- [ ] Fix applied
- [ ] Tests pass
- [ ] No regressions